{"t": 117.02, "e": 122.05, "line": "You're the calm after every storm I've been through"},
{"t": 123.66, "e": 127.59, "line": "No one does it like you do"},
{"t": 128.5, "e": 131.32, "line": "We've had our highs, we've had our lows"},
{"t": 133.4, "e": 137.31, "line": "But somehow love just deeper grows"},
{"t": 138.32, "e": 142.32, "line": "And when I fall, you pull me through"},
{"t": 142.27, "e": 147.31, "line": "There's no one, baby, quite like you"},
{"t": 147.26, "e": 152.07, "line": "I've been running round and round"},
{"t": 152.02, "e": 157.06, "line": "This circle that never ends"},
{"t": 157.01, "e": 161.87, "line": "But now I know I've finally found"},
{"t": 162.14, "e": 166.71, "line": "My lover and my best friend"},
{"t": 168.32, "e": 171.91, "line": "Every time you say my name"},
{"t": 171.94, "e": 176.62, "line": "The world just fades away"},
{"t": 178.25, "e": 181.8, "line": "And in your eyes I see my place"},
{"t": 183.38, "e": 186.73, "line": "Forever I will stay"},
